# The examples-repo top-level .gitignore excludes .next/ and node_modules/
# everywhere. This example intentionally vendors the FINAL build artifact —
# umami's `next build` output (output: standalone) — because the real build
# needs a live database and network access (GeoIP download), neither of which
# the framework-test harness provides at build time. Re-include exactly the
# standalone tree; keep the app-level node_modules (pnpm install of the
# prisma CLI) ignored.
!/.next/
/.next/*
!/.next/standalone/
!/.next/standalone/**
